The reviewer did not approve src/money.ts. Fix exactly these problems and nothing else, in src/money.ts only:

1. formatCents(0) must return "$0.00"; the cents remainder must be zero-padded to 2 digits (formatCents(105) must return "$1.05", not "$1.5").
2. formatCents must handle negatives with the sign before the dollar sign: formatCents(-250) must return "-$2.50". Do not use Math.floor or % on the raw negative value. Use abs = Math.abs(cents), sign = cents < 0 ? '-' : '', and dollars = Math.floor(abs / 100).
3. formatReceipt([{label:"Tea",cents:350},{label:"Refund",cents:-100}]) must produce "Tea: $3.50\nRefund: -$1.00\nTotal: $2.50"; formatReceipt([]) must produce "Total: $0.00". These should follow from fixes 1 and 2 with no change to formatReceipt.

